  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *batido*",
    "*batir huevos* = to beat eggs (*Bate los huevos con un tenedor* — Beat the eggs with a fork)",
    "*batir nata* = to whip cream",
    "*batir un récord* = to beat a record (*Batió el récord mundial* — He broke the world record)",
    "*batir al enemigo/al rival* = to defeat the enemy/opponent",
    "*batirse* (reflexive) = to fight, to duel (*batirse en duelo* — to fight a duel)",
    "Related: *el batido* = milkshake/smoothie; *la batidora* = blender/mixer; *el batidor* = whisk"
  ],
